"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: leaders_marketplace
#: model:mail.template,body_html:leaders_marketplace.mail_template_vendor_settlement_debt
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"<p>Your settlement <strong t-out=\"object.name\"/> closes with an amount you owe the marketplace: <strong><t t-out=\"-object.net_amount\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': object.currency_id}\"/></strong> (cash collected on delivery exceeds your other earnings for the period). Please transfer it to the marketplace.</p><p><a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/my/vendor/settlements\">Open in your vendor portal</a></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 13px;\">\n"
"<p>تنتهي تسويتك <strong t-out=\"object.name\"/> بمبلغ مستحق عليك للسوق: <strong><t t-out=\"-object.net_amount\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'monetary', 'display_currency': object.currency_id}\"/></strong> (المبالغ المحصلة عند الاستلام تتجاوز أرباحك الأخرى عن الفترة). يرجى تحويله إلى السوق.</p><p><a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/my/vendor/settlements\">افتح في بوابة البائع</a></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

